# Unapproved Review Files

When a file is under review and **not yet approved**, treat edits to it as a conflict risk.

## Blocking rule

- If the next change would touch an **unapproved (review-pending) file**, **do not implement** that change.
- Stop and tell the user that a **conflicting file** would result, then ask whether implementation may proceed.

## Non-conflicting work first

- If the same implementation scope also includes work on **non-conflicting** files (not under unapproved review), **implement those first**.
- Do this even while the unapproved conflicting files remain unapproved; do not block the whole scope on the pending review.
